1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,240
So I decided to make the design simpler.

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:09,860
Instead of asking users to build any structure from sketch,

3
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:14,180
the system would offer a few ready-made patterns.

4
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:18,460
Linear, soloed, hub and spoke and circle.

5
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:22,460
This gives users a little less freedom,

6
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:28,620
but made the system much easier to understand and set up.

